OL,3,GNEWSAArson accused had 'extreme
OL,4,Aright-wing mindset'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with an "extreme right-wing
OL,7,Fmindset" embarked on a campaign of
OL,8,Fviolence targeting a restaurant and 5G
OL,9,Fmasts before he was arrested while
OL,10,Fcarrying a crossbow, the Old Bailey has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FMilo Creese, 40, from Ottershaw in
OL,14,FSurrey, denies eight charges including
OL,15,Fan attempt to set fire to the 3 Rooms
OL,16,FIndian Restaurant in Chertsey, early on
OL,17,F31 October 2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
