OL,3,GNEWSAArson accused had 'extreme
OL,4,Aright-wing mindset'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors heard Creese was caught on CCTV
OL,7,Fputting an envelope containing ball
OL,8,Fbearings through the restaurant's
OL,9,Fletterbox and setting fire to it,
OL,10,Fbefore fleeing on his bicycle.
OL,12,FThe jury heard the fire did not spread
OL,13,Fbeyond a porch because a door was shut,
OL,14,Fbut residents in flats above had
OL,15,Freported breathing difficulties.
